#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:3
#: f0c47b3a4bc74d36b5a7059a21cf7f15
msgid "成分梯度（Composition Gradient）"
msgstr "Composition Gradient"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:5
#: ac2281d0b22c4aca87cfefcb55a554a7
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:7
#: e86ac8a0cafa4da385014e1d6a618c2b
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:9
#: fb97e64623ae44b9bb926679df57f771
msgid ""
"`Composition Gradient` 沿晶格 `a`、`b` 或 `c` 方向排列可替换原子，再把它们分"
"成原子数尽量相同的若干层。第一层使用起始成分，最后一层使用结束成分，中间层做"
"线性插值。卡片只重新分配元素，不移动原子，也不改变晶胞。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:11
#: 926189b72c0449b4afdef9bccde4b77c
msgid ""
"它适合扩散偶、梯度合金和界面过渡层。如果你需要的是多个空间均匀、但全局成分不"
"同的合金结构，应使用 `Composition Space Sampling → Random Occupancy`，而不是"
"这张卡。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:13
#: 02d68cba72ec4243960a5db92dc51921
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:15
#: a6e3c645c38f44928cdc5b7192daed6c
msgid ""
"程序先把候选位点沿指定晶格轴的分数坐标 $s$ 包裹到 $[0,1)$，排序后分箱。第 "
"$b$ 个 分箱中心对应 $t_b\\in[0,1]$，其目标成分由起点和终点线性插值："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:18
#: 8da6daf90f69496a8a2bdfbcbae7ac96
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf c(t_b)=(1-t_b)\\mathbf c_{\\mathrm{start}}\n"
"+t_b\\mathbf c_{\\mathrm{end}}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:23
#: 15f0c0aec32548799436ee4245b07b92
msgid ""
"若该箱有 $N_b$ 个位点，理想计数为 $N_b c_e$。程序先取 $n_e=\\lfloor N_b "
"c_e\\rfloor$，再把剩余位点按小数余数从大到小补给各元素，保证 $\\sum_e "
"n_e=N_b$。所以有限晶胞中的实际比例是最接近目标的整数实现，不会逐箱精确等于 连"
"续比例。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:28
#: 34eec9aa4d3c4f7c8dee334585ca411a
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:30
#: 9958e08972b94fbfad802c59bc878694
msgid "场景：模型缺少扩散偶过渡层"
msgstr "Scenario: A diffusion-couple transition layer is missing"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:32
#: 9763e09976924d3c97a27ead00232b97
msgid ""
"Ni-Co 训练集包含纯 Ni、纯 Co 和均匀随机合金，但没有从 Ni-rich 到 Co-rich 的空"
"间过渡结构。模型在界面扩散偶上出现系统误差。"
msgstr ""
"A Ni-Co training set contains pure Ni, pure Co, and homogeneous random "
"alloys but no spatial transition from Ni-rich to Co-rich material. The model "
"consequently shows systematic error at a diffusion-couple interface."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:34
#: 868832adb0c242b1b0b72579f4cede5e
msgid ""
"**输入：** 沿晶格 `a` 方向足够长的 Ni 或 Ni-Co 超胞。 **目标：** 生成晶格 "
"`a` 方向从 `Ni:1,Co:0` 到 `Ni:0,Co:1` 的配比梯度。 **参数设置：** `输入元素`"
"填 `Ni,Co`，`梯度轴`选择 `a`，`分箱数`填 `8`， `目标元素`填 `Ni,Co`，`每个输"
"入的样本数`填 `3`，并开启`使用随机种子`。 **输出：** 每个输入结构生成 3 个具"
"有相同层配比、不同层内随机排布的梯度结构。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 按晶"
"格 `a` 方向分层统计元素比例，应从 Ni-rich 单调过渡到 Co-rich；重训后扩散偶界"
"面测试误差应下降。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:41
#: edcb2fd5235f427fa02a7c3e87e731d4
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:43
#: e6f92c8ab53c40459cb09cc212bdbeff
msgid "元素（elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:45
#: d62dd06324e74a529b61275eb4188734
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Ni,Co`。梯度端点中参与插值的元素集合。二元扩散偶写两个元素即可，"
"三元过渡层把你关心的所有成分变化元素都列进去。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Ni,Co`. Elements whose endpoint fractions are interpolated. "
"Two elements are sufficient for a binary diffusion couple; list every "
"composition-varying element for a ternary transition layer."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:47
#: a90f712ba4cf4f74a4ab3f9a988b76c0
msgid "起始成分（start_composition）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:49
#: 54765a9b5291490b8349dc76402fac51
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Ni:1,Co:0`。梯度起点的目标元素比例，对应 axis 低坐标端。比例不要"
"求归一化，各元素相对比值决定第一层的目标配比。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Ni:1,Co:0`. Target ratios at the low-coordinate end of the "
"selected axis. Values need not be normalized; their relative magnitudes set "
"the first bin's composition."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:51
#: 8f2f04b9ce98481eba5471c7f6ba6942
msgid "结束成分（end_composition）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:53
#: 4a85a889e64640499af85dfaffec0a25
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `Ni:0,Co:1`。梯度终点的目标元素比例，对应 axis 高坐标端。扩散偶通"
"常把一个元素从 1 过渡到 0、另一个从 0 过渡到 1。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `Ni:0,Co:1`. Target ratios at the high-coordinate end. A "
"binary diffusion couple commonly changes one element from 1 to 0 and the "
"other from 0 to 1."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:55
#: 8b822fe076804b9fabd60e72cb1fd666
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:57
#: fca36a7693e646bbb8f1e3b363d0b1cd
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `a`，可选 `a`、`b` 或 `c`。它们表示晶格坐标方向，不是笛卡尔 X/Y/"
"Z。程序按对应的分数坐标从低到高排列原子：起始成分放在低坐标端，结束成分放在高"
"坐标端。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:59
#: 943eadcbda8946b2afa6eb68d1dc550e
msgid ""
"选真实扩散方向或界面法向。旧配置中的 `x/y/z` 仍可加载，并分别按 `a/b/c` 处"
"理。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:61
#: 74317fece4e741a49669b5620634e74a
msgid ""
"如果这个方向是周期的，晶胞高坐标端会和低坐标端相接。起止成分不同时，周期边界"
"处会出现一次额外的成分突变；做周期扩散偶时要确认这正是你想要的边界条件。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:63
#: 84d9a83d2ccb4be99f3f7fa5ff91ad46
msgid "分箱数（bins）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:65
#: 8c7fe5dd538c4c5f84126a7e8915dc9c
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 8。程序按位置排序后，把候选原子分成原子数尽量相同的若干组；它不是"
"按等距离切出若干个等厚空间层。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:67
#: f6b79a9830524c7ea2ba3d3a490a1f0e
msgid ""
"`分箱数`（`bins`）越大，成分变化看起来越细，但每层原子越少、整数取整误差越"
"大。某层有 `N` 个候选原子时，单个元素能够表达的最小成分步长约为 `1/N`。例如每"
"层只有 4 个原子，只能稳定表达 0%、25%、50%、75% 和 100%。如果输入只有 32 个候"
"选原子，设 8 层已经意味着每层约 4 个原子。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:69
#: 689e2c69f3af44838a51b4533f4770cb
msgid "目标元素（target_elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:71
#: d833c482e23542d284da46b71bc1e2de
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。这里填写输入结构中允许被替换的现有元素，不是输出元素。留空会让"
"所有原子都参与重新分配；例如输入含 Ni、Co、Al，而 `elements=Ni,Co` 时，Al 也"
"会被改成 Ni 或 Co。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:73
#: 556dda291c954967a5e0349ac98c9800
msgid ""
"多组元体系通常应显式填写，例如 `Ni,Co`，以保留 Al 子晶格。当前参数只能按元素"
"筛选，不能按空间区域或 `group` 标签筛选。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:75
#: c93147d4bc4449128ecf4e014a2f962b
msgid "样本数（samples）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:77
#: 50acae37b36e4116860d5359907fc9ab
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成几个随机排布。同一层的元素数量不变，改变的只是"
"这些元素落在哪些候选位点上。1-3 个适合补少量扩散偶构型；如果要研究同一成分梯"
"度下的局域无序差异，可以增加输出数量。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:79
#: 12d9fc65fded442ab9755afacc075773
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:81
#: 2964fe73cca442b0ade8916455f08ae4
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。需要可复现训练集或对比实验时打开；最终大规模随机探索可以"
"关掉，但结果不能逐帧复现。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enable for a reproducible training set or "
"controlled comparison. It may be disabled for large exploratory sampling, "
"but individual frames will not be reproducible."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:83
#: c5e81ffc790e48e4a55123cc7031f935
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:85
#: e03f62a861f44510ae17cda2c6ef13da
msgid "`int`，默认 0。同一输入、同一参数、同一 seed 生成同一批候选。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`. Identical input, parameters, and seed produce the same "
"candidates."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:87
#: 0b88d3e1e82544c091cd2cb9e5a98997
msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:89
#: dfedeaf555814ca6bbf16cb4d9584d2d
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:91
#: 474118c694024a2f927471b34b86de24
msgid "二元扩散偶"
msgstr "Binary diffusion couple"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:93
#: c4ca38a7210645a1999735cba7e255d3
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CompositionGradientCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"elements\": \"Ni,Co\",\n"
"    \"start_composition\": \"Ni:1,Co:0\",\n"
"    \"end_composition\": \"Ni:0,Co:1\",\n"
"    \"axis\": \"a\",\n"
"    \"bins\": 8,\n"
"    \"target_elements\": \"Ni,Co\",\n"
"    \"samples\": 3,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:110
#: 7a375b5a17504d19a31aef52fe2621eb
msgid "用于 Ni-rich 到 Co-rich 的一维过渡层。"
msgstr "A one-dimensional transition from Ni-rich to Co-rich material."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:112
#: ffa98ef860664ba6a833574b3f3456d3
msgid "三元梯度层"
msgstr "Ternary graded layer"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:114
#: bd499a049d24486daa88aee0e81836df
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CompositionGradientCard\",\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"elements\": \"Co,Cr,Ni\",\n"
"    \"start_composition\": \"Co:0.8,Cr:0.1,Ni:0.1\",\n"
"    \"end_composition\": \"Co:0.1,Cr:0.4,Ni:0.5\",\n"
"    \"axis\": \"c\",\n"
"    \"bins\": 10,\n"
"    \"target_elements\": \"Co,Cr,Ni\",\n"
"    \"samples\": 2,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 9\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:131
#: 4b6f26279db04fcf96c999f87017532c
msgid "用于多元合金的层状成分过渡。"
msgstr "A layered composition transition in a multicomponent alloy."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:133
#: 467161850bd44f5aba06af8bb708d4a5
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:135
#: c1a2b3fa00184593938789f14def6508
msgid ""
"`Super Cell → Composition Gradient → Geometry Filter`：先给梯度方向足够层数，"
"再做配比梯度和几何检查。"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell -> Composition Gradient -> Geometry Filter`: create enough "
"layers along the gradient, assign compositions, then check geometry."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:136
#: 535208e77d17414f8de6c2030c002483
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Composition Gradient → Atomic "
"Perturb`：先生成晶体模板，再加空间成分梯度和局部位移。"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder -> Super Cell -> Composition Gradient -> Atomic "
"Perturb`: build a crystal template, then add a spatial composition gradient "
"and local displacements."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:137
#: 70b0b47b6c49452b871e207cf66f2703
msgid "`Composition Gradient → FPS Filter`：生成多组梯度结构后选代表帧。"
msgstr ""
"`Composition Gradient -> FPS Filter`: select representative frames from "
"several graded structures."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:139
#: 28cde55bb34f4533958bfd2d7ed4d2fc
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:141
#: 2f1cdf24bf3b4fd2a6239004e26f641e
msgid ""
"**层内成分不等于目标小数。** 原子数是整数，每层按最接近的整数计数分配。增大超"
"胞或减少 `分箱数`（`bins`）可以提高每层成分分辨率。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:143
#: ab439cb6a71d4db8a7453bfa30365acf
msgid ""
"**运行报错或没有输出。** `元素`（`elements`）少于 2 个、起止成分解析失败，或 "
"`目标元素`（`target_elements`）没有匹配到原子。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:145
#: a0ac6dc5a047499da5b5a376054abb90
msgid ""
"**倾斜晶胞中的方向怎么看。** `a/b/c` 始终表示晶格分数坐标方向。即使晶格向量倾"
"斜，也不会切换成笛卡尔 X/Y/Z。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:147
#: 78074c5a8b9443708bd85850d009ee79
msgid ""
"**为什么周期边界处还有一个突变界面。** 周期方向的高坐标端会与低坐标端相接，而"
"线性梯度的结束成分通常不同于起始成分。需要连续周期成分场时，这张卡当前不适"
"用。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:149
#: fa1ccb0c59a8437993e01d26f0f94b3f
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/composition-gradient-card.md:151
#: 9c3812632b4b41e397f174773bb411ef
msgid ""
"`CompGrad(ax={a|b|c},b={bins},s={seed})`。`s` 只在 `use_seed=True` 时出现。"
msgstr ""

